# Route A: ~200s media (e.g. ~/Videos/new_video_200s.mp4) + dynamic cap on path A (h1-eth0) for
# online simplex (wT,wD,wL) evaluation. Path B: static rate from the chosen --scenario.
# Step times (s from tc start): 0, 50, 100. Hold 10 Mbit/s from 100s through end of run (e.g. 200s); no step at 150.
# Suggested analysis phases (tc-relative): 0-50, 50-100, 100-150, 150-200 — use
#   parse_logs.phase_steady_windows_from_tc_bw(..., transition_sec=10) for 40s steady per 50s phase.
IFACE=h1-eth0

0 20
50 30
100 10
